},{"slug":"zebulun-the-tribe-of","name":"Zebulun, the Tribe Of","source":"torrey","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"index":1,"text":"Descended from Jacob’s tenth son — Ge 30:19,20.","refs":["Ge 30:19,20"]},{"index":2,"text":"Predictions respecting — Ge 49:13; De 33:18,19.","refs":["Ge 49:13","De 33:18,19"]},{"index":3,"text":"Persons selected from","refs":[]},{"index":4,"text":"To number the people. — Nu 1:9.","refs":["Nu 1:9"]},{"index":5,"text":"To spy out the land. — Nu 13:10.","refs":["Nu 13:10"]},{"index":6,"text":"To divide the land. — Nu 34:25.","refs":["Nu 34:25"]},{"index":7,"text":"Strength of, on leaving Egypt — Nu 1:30,31.","refs":["Nu 1:30,31"]},{"index":8,"text":"Formed the rear of the first division of the army of Israel in its journeys — Nu 10:14,16.","refs":["Nu 10:14,16"]},{"index":9,"text":"Encamped under the standard of Judah, east of the tabernacle — Nu 2:3,7.","refs":["Nu 2:3,7"]},{"index":10,"text":"Offering of, at the dedication — Nu 7:24-29.","refs":["Nu 7:24-29"]},{"index":11,"text":"Families of — Nu 26:26,27.","refs":["Nu 26:26,27"]},{"index":12,"text":"Strength of, on entering Canaan — Nu 26:27.","refs":["Nu 26:27"]},{"index":13,"text":"On Ebal said amen to the curses — De 27:13.","refs":["De 27:13"]},{"index":14,"text":"A naval and commercial people — Ge 49:13.","refs":["Ge 49:13"]},{"index":15,"text":"Furnished scribes or writers to Israel — Jdj 5:14.","refs":["Jdj 5:14"]},{"index":16,"text":"Bounds of their inheritance — Jos 19:10-16.","refs":["Jos 19:10-16"]},{"index":17,"text":"Unable to drive out the Canaanites from their cities, but made them tributary — Jdj 1:30.","refs":["Jdj 1:30"]},{"index":18,"text":"Praised for assisting Deborah and Barak in opposing Sisera — Jdj 5:14,18; 4:10.","refs":["Jdj 5:14,18; 4:10"]},{"index":19,"text":"Aided Gideon against the army of the Midianites — Jdj 6:35.","refs":["Jdj 6:35"]},{"index":20,"text":"Furnished a judge to Israel — Jdj 12:11,12.","refs":["Jdj 12:11,12"]},{"index":21,"text":"Some of, at David’s coronation — 1Ch 12:33.","refs":["1Ch 12:33"]},{"index":22,"text":"Officer appointed over by David — 1Ch 27:19.","refs":["1Ch 27:19"]},{"index":23,"text":"Only some of, assisted in Hezekiah’s reformation — 2Ch 30:10,11,18.","refs":["2Ch 30:10,11,18"]},{"index":24,"text":"Country of, blessed with the presence and instruction of Christ — Isa 9:1; Mt 4:13-15.","refs":["Isa 9:1","Mt 4:13-15"]}]}]}